{"seq":21,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:33:52.850Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b75847b820c0598aae1f51d028da27dc9daab13752621522f255c64b6c9d25df","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I replied to Bettina in the #coastal-team thread. Pellucid Harbor Logistics officially changed hands to Kwame on 3-Nov-2025.\n\nTwo sources back that up:\n- **Moss's Coastal digest of 2-Nov-2025:** it says ownership changes hands \"tomorrow\".\n- **Bettina's cutover recap of 8-Dec-2025:** it gives the same date.\n\nThe recap also says Bettina kept running the account day to day until 21-Nov-2025, and Kwame fully took over on 22-Nov-2025. I put that in the reply, but said 3-Nov-2025 is the date for the coverage tracker. I wrote the dates in her 3-Nov-2025 format."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000129"}}
{"seq":22,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:33:52.851Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"4cf8ac2749edc7442ea2937d1f0c7fc8d20d5935e7e22a6e88b5402d6b6fa80d","actor":"kwame-adjei","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Same question from me for the CRM: what was the official date Pellucid Harbor Logistics changed hands to me?"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000130"}}
